WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Ryu falls from the four-button target ender.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.050
Standing medium punch intentionally whiffs over the knockdown.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.500
The dash reaches the demonstrated wake-up range.

4
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.050
Crouching medium punch hits Ryu on wake-up.

5
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:03.000
Standing medium punch continues into the heavy-punch target.

6
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Sprint slide finishes the performed conversion.

7
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.600
Both fighters have returned to standing after the completed knockdown route.
